: "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"source_term": "tuple", "target_term": "元组"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>为一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>和<MATH_0003>为<MATH_0004>上的概形（schemes）。假设<MATH_0005>有有限多个不可约分支（irreducible components），其泛点（generic points）为<MATH_0006>。设<MATH_0007>为<MATH_0008>的像（image）。\n考虑如下映射（map）\n<MATHSEG_0001>上的有理映射（maps）<MATHSEG_0002>从<MATHSEG_0003>到<MATHSEG_0004>，其中<MATHSEG_0005>位于<MATHSEG_0006>之上，且<MATHSEG_0007>是一个局部<MATHSEG_0008>-代数映射（algebra map）<MATHSEG_0009>\n它将<MATH_0009>送到<MATH_0010>元组（tuple），其中<MATH_0011>且<MATH_0012>。则\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 若<MATH_0013>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，则该映射（map）是单射（injective）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 若<MATH_0014>是局部有限表示（locally of finite presentation）的，则该映射（map）是双射（bijective）。\n<STRUCT_0004> 若<MATH_0015>是局部有限型（locally of finite type）的，且<MATH_0016>是既约（reduced）的，则该映射（map）是双射（bijective）。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:8ce5beedf596f3c35130eb6a978bb5b4353fd7580000858149a7e1657bb96739", "unit_id": "tag:0BX8:statement", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "引理开头给出的基底对象。", "source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "基底上的两个对象。", "source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"context": "假设中数量有限的分支。", "source_term": "irreducible components", "target_term": "不可约分支"}, {"context": "各不可约分支所对应的点。", "source_term": "generic points", "target_term": "泛点"}, {"context": "给出的点在基底中的像。", "source_term": "image", "target_term": "像"}, {"context": "引理所考察的映射。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "所考察映射的定义域中的有理映射。", "source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "目标中的局部代数映射。", "source_term": "algebra map", "target_term": "代数映射"}, {"context": "给定元素被送到的有序元组。", "source_term": "tuple", "target_term": "元组"}, {"context": "第一项中的有限性条件。", "source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"context": "第一项断言具有单射性的映射。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "第一项断言的性质。", "source_term": "injective", "target_term": "单射"}, {"context": "第二项中的有限性条件。", "source_term": "locally of finite presentation", "target_term": "局部有限表示"}, {"context": "第二项断言具有双射性的映射。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "第二项断言的性质。", "source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}, {"context": "第三项中的有限性条件。", "source_term": "locally of finite type", "target_term": "局部有限型"}, {"context": "第三项中对概形的另一条件。", "source_term": "reduced", "target_term": "既约"}, {"context": "第三项断言具有双射性的映射。", "source_term": "map", "target_term": "映射"}, {"context": "第三项断言的性质。", "source_term": "bijective", "target_term": "双射"}]}
